          "title": "What worked",
          "bullets": [
            "**Texts close fast.** 61% of text RSVPs came within an hour of the send.",
            "**One clear link.** Every message pointed to the same form, so nothing leaked to a second page.",
            "**Dropping people who already said yes.** Nobody who RSVP'd got another invite."
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "Change",
          "tag_style": "ghost",
          "title": "What we change",
          "bullets": [
            "**Email 3 was one too many.** It cost little but added the most unsubscribes, 41.",
            "**378 texts never arrived.** Most were landlines. We clean those out before the next send.",
            "**We missed 600 members with no email topic set.** That one is on us, it is fixed for summer."
          ]
        }
      ]
